{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"413c861f-1325-4e8a-91fb-4983088e8f29","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The interdependent state, cache-invalidation, defensive-copy, and monetary-rounding bugs across all four modules have been resolved according to specifications:\n\n1. **`store.py` (`TenantStore`)**:\n   - Stores unit rate and discount rate as `Decimal` instances.\n   - Initial tenant creation sets `version = 1`. Updating an existing tenant via `upsert_tenant` increments `version` by 1 and fires invalidation hooks.\n   - `update_tenant_tier` updates the rates, increments `version` by 1, and fires invalidation hooks `(tenant_id, None)`.\n   - `record_usage` validates `units \u003e= 0` and `unit_rate \u003e= 0`, increments `version` by 1, and fires hooks `(tenant_id, period)`.\n   - `get_tenant` and `get_snapshot` return defensive deep copies.\n\n2. **`cache.py` (`InvoiceCache`)**:\n   - `get` returns a deep copy of cached invoice; validates `version` against cached invoice version if provided.\n   - `set` resolves and associates version, storing a deep copy so mutations cannot affect internal cache state.\n   - `invalidate` clears `(tenant_id, period)` when `period` is given, or all cached periods for `tenant_id` when `period is None`, returning the count of removed entries.\n   - `clear` wipes all cached entries.\n\n3. **`billing.py` (`calculate_invoice`)**:\n   - Uses `Decimal` arithmetic exclusively with `quantize(Decimal(\"0.01\"), rounding=ROUND_HALF_UP)`.\n   - If `cached_invoice` is provided and matches `(tenant_id, period, version)`, returns a defensive deep copy without reapplying discounts. Otherwise recomputes authoritatively.\n   - Follows the prescribed calculation and quantization order: per-line totals $\\to$ subtotal $\\to$ discount $\\to$ total.\n\n4. **`api.py` (`BillingAPI`)**:\n   - Wires `store.register_invalidation_hook(cache.invalidate)`.\n   - `preview_invoice` looks up by `(tenant_id, period, version=snapshot[\"version\"])`, calculates and caches on miss, and returns a defensive deep copy.\n   - `record_usage` and `change_tier_and_preview` ensure cache invalidation across appropriate periods.\n","duration_seconds":74.9651864,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":51386,"output_tokens":6398,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":253516,"total_tokens":57784}}}
